    "detailed_description": "Neural construct is a 2-4 player educational online party game that allows you to construct a neural network (AI) that you can change and customize to compete with other players.<br><br><strong>Gameplay :</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Try to construct a neural network with the resources and intel that you have.</li><li> Try to accomplish the given task to gain points.</li><li>Sabotage the other players.</li><li> Adapt quickly!</li><li>Win by completing your given task and having the most points. </li><li>Learn about neural networks while having fun.</li><li>Why are you trying to push me over the edge?</li></ul>",
